# Typed numbers in the steppers
step-typed-hint = Click the number to type another; Enter applies, Esc leaves it as it was.
step-typed-range = Out of bounds: between { $min } and { $max }. Enter applies, Esc leaves it as it was.
tariff-imports-only = The tariff is charged on what the country imports. What it exports pays no tariff here: it pays the buying country's.
